### Requires bearer token
@header.Authorization = Bearer secret
GET /secure
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ok": true,
  "message": "authorized"
}

### [401] No token at all
@header.Authorization = !
GET /secure
Content-Type: application/json

{"ok":false,"error":"missing bearer token"}

### Wrong token falls through (no match)
GET /public
Content-Type: application/json

{"ok":true,"public":true}
